  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "After lunch, I sit on the comfortable sofa in our living room and read a book about animals. My sister is tired after playing outside, so she comes to rest beside me. She puts her head on a pillow and is soon asleep. I leave the television off because she needs to sleep, and the room stays quiet. Light comes through the window and past the curtain, making the floor bright near the chair. A plant stands on the table, and the lamp waits beside the sofa for evening. When I finish a page, I look at the clock and then at the picture above us. There are more books on the shelf, but I keep reading this story until my sister wakes up. Later, we can watch a short show together before dinner.",
    "textZh": "午餐後，我坐在客廳裡舒適的沙發上，讀一本關於動物的書。妹妹在外面玩累了，所以過來我身旁休息。她把頭靠在枕頭上，很快就睡著了。她需要睡覺，所以我讓電視保持關著，房間也維持安靜。陽光穿過窗戶、照過窗簾，讓椅子附近的地板明亮起來。桌上有一盆植物，沙發旁的檯燈等到晚上再使用。讀完一頁時，我看看時鐘，再看看我們上方的圖畫。架子上還有更多書，但我繼續讀這個故事，直到妹妹醒來。晚點晚餐前，我們可以一起看一個短節目。",
